{
  "_comment": "Role/label locators for the brand QA harnesses (scripts/qa/lib/ui.mjs makeLocate). Update labels here when the brand pass renames a control; a name may be a string (exact) or {\"regex\": \"...\"}. `label` uses getByLabel, `text` uses getByText, `css` uses page.locator (only for controls whose accessible name is not stable, e.g. the save chip). Names verified in the DOM of the integrated candidate 7083387.",
